    "title": "Vermilion County Methamphetamine Dealer and Burglar Sentenced to Prison - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WHPO ,\n1 days ago On December 15, 2025, Arnoldo Molina (DOB: 4/6/1976), formerly of Danville, Illinois, pleaded guilty in two separate cases to Methamphetamine Delivery, a class 1 felony, and to Burglary, a class 2 felony. Molina was sentenced to 5 years in prison, and following his term of imprisonment, will serve a term of 1-year mandatory supervised release. The plea and sentencing hearing were presided over by Judge Mark S. Goodwin. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
